        <item>
            <title>3.21.0</title>
            <pubDate>Fri, 06 Nov 2026 16:35:01 +0900</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/Saqoosha/Canopy</link>
            <sparkle:version>213</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>3.21.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[### Features
- The launcher's session chip for another Mac now offers New session and Continue the latest session, like the chip for this Mac. Continue resumes the selected folder's newest closed session with your prompt, or joins a session open on that Mac and leaves the prompt in the composer.
- The connection-lost overlay has a Close button, so a pane that could not reconnect can be closed from there. A session on another Mac stays in the sidebar.

### Bug Fixes
- The session chip for another Mac no longer lists sessions from every folder; it shows only the selected folder's closed sessions.
- A session reopened after its connection failed no longer shows the failure overlay over a working pane.
]]></description>
